## Why the marker icons disappear

Your style (or the `icon-image` property on a layer) still points to the image name **`'pin'`**. Since `map.addImage('pin', …)` never ran, the style can’t find the image and falls back to the “missing-icon” placeholder (a transparent square). Once the image is successfully added, the icons re-appear automatically—no further changes to the layer definition are needed.

