## Quick checklist after fixing `loadImage`

| ✅ | Item |
|---|------|
| **✅ Replace all `map.loadImage(url, cb)` calls** with the promise version (or `await`). |
| **✅ Verify that the image name you add (`'pin'`) matches the `icon-image` value** used in your style/layer. |
| **✅ Ensure the image URL is reachable (CORS, correct protocol, etc.)** – a 404 will now surface as a rejected promise. |
| **✅ If you use `addImage` with the `sdf` option, keep the same options**: `map.addImage('pin', data, { sdf: true })`. |
| **✅ Re-run the app** – the icons should now render. |

