| ✅ Done? | What to verify |
|---------|----------------|
| **Namespace** | All `mapboxgl` references → `maplibregl`. |
| **Style URL** | Not a `mapbox://…` URL; uses a public vector style (e.g., OpenFreeMap, MapTiler, your own). |
| **`loadImage` usage** | Converted to promise (`await` or `.then`). |
| **Timing** | `addImage` runs **after** the `load` (or `styledata`) event. |
| **Image source** | URL is reachable (CORS allowed) and returns an image format supported by the browser (PNG, JPEG, SVG). |
| **Layer reference** | `icon-image` property matches the name you passed to `addImage` (`'pin'`). |
| **Sprite fallback** | If you rely on the style’s default sprite, make sure the style’s `sprite` URL is reachable and not a `mapbox://` URL. |

If you follow the steps above and the console no longer shows “callback passed to `map.loadImage` is not being called”, the icons will appear.

