### TL;DR

```js
// Old (Mapbox)
map.loadImage(url, (err, img) => { if (err) throw err; map.addImage('pin', img); });

// New (MapLibre)
const { data: img } = await map.loadImage(url);
map.addImage('pin', img);
```

